# Appearance page (check in each look). Material window 1040x700 at 440,205, page column from x about 772.
ipc panels settings appearance
wait 2
shot a1-top
note A1 Material: two preview cards side by side, chosen one ringed in primary with check-circle and bold primary name, text under them word for word as QML. Glass: "Look" row with two 128x80 thumbnails and caption names.
ptr move 1230 330 sleep 600 glide 1230 330 100
wait 1
shot a2-hover
note A2 hovering the not-chosen card shows a faint ring (35 percent) round it. Card centre is a guess: read from a1-top.
ptr move 1230 330 sleep 300 down
wait 1
shot a2-press
note A2 while pressed the picture shrinks a little (0.98).
ptr move 1230 330 glide 1500 700 200 up
wait 1
ptr move 1100 500 sleep 200 scroll 0 5
wait 1
shot a3
note A3 Appearance mode segmented (Auto / Light / Dark): read the positions here; Auto detail "Light from sunrise (...) to sunset (...)" in the clock format; Light: detail gone; 24-hour toggle flips "17:30" and "5:30 PM".
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 10
wait 1
shot a4
note A4 App icons: Material shows 6 options (Themed second), Glass 5; detail text per option as QML. A5 Material colours: seed swatches, 3 px ring, detail "This colour" / "Your wallpaper, like Material You"; Transparency slider detail "50%: panels, menus..." and at left end "Solid. Slide to...". A6 Glass accent swatches, detail "Following the wallpaper" only for the wallpaper swatch (batch 1 found the wallpaper-following accent red in Rust, orange in QML).
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 20
wait 1
shot a7
note A7 Glass: the "Glass" link shows its value (Glass/Frost/Solid/Custom) and opens the Glass page; Material: "Match apps" link opens the Match apps page. A8 Glass shows Reduce transparency, Material does not.
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 30
wait 1
shot a9
note A9 More options: Icon contrast only when App icons is Clear or Tinted; Emoji row Noto/Apple/Fluent segmented; with a missing font the detail "ttf-apple-emoji isn't installed; showing Noto until it is" and an "Install font" button left of the segmented (Material 40 px tonal pill). Rust standalone used to fail this (#21).
# MANUAL: A3 click Auto, Light and the 24-hour toggle and check details; A4/A5/A6 click every option, swatch and style and compare details with the plan's text
# MANUAL: A9 set emoji.style to a font that isn't installed and check the Install font button
# MANUAL: A10 hover a menu icon choice 1 s: tooltip with its name (e.g. "Rocket"); click it: accent ring + tint; distro choice shows the distro logo
# MANUAL: A11 icon theme dropdown: "Automatic" then installed themes (do not pick one, restarts the shell)
# MANUAL: A12 click "macOS" shortcut symbols: detail "e.g. ..." style; Auto: footer gets "; Auto follows the icon..."
ipc panels close
